Package: solarispkn-verity
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, openssl
Recommends: solarispkn-verity-tree
Description: userspace Merkle-tree and signature tools for dm-verity
 Experimental Python tools for building and checking Merkle manifests
 and validating detached root hash PKCS#7 signatures.
 .
 This does not install a kernel module or enable Secure Boot.

Package: solarispkn-verity-tree
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: experimental AF_ALG Merkle tree formatter and verifier
 Linux userspace Merkle tree utility using AF_ALG for digests.
 .
 Requires an appropriate kernel hash implementation for the requested
 algorithm; does not install a BLAKE3 provider or enforce dm-verity.
